# Base URL of the `server` app's API. Must be prefixed EXPO_PUBLIC_ to be exposed to client code.
#
# - Web / iOS or Android simulator on this machine: http://localhost:6622 (the default if unset,
#   so you can leave this line commented out / absent for that case).
# - Expo Go on a physical device: use this machine's LAN IP instead — "localhost" on the phone
#   means the phone itself, not this computer. Find it with `ipconfig` (Windows) / `ifconfig` or
#   `ipconfig getifaddr en0` (macOS), and make sure the phone is on the same Wi-Fi network.
#   This value is machine- and network-specific and WILL change over time — never copy the
#   example IP below verbatim, and don't commit your real one anywhere but your own `.env`.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.100:6622
